# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Client build configuration. Everything here is PUBLIC.
#
# Vite inlines every VITE_* value into the shipped JavaScript bundle. Anyone who
# loads the site can read them. NEVER put an API key, token, or password in this
# file or in any .env file consumed by the client build.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Optional: URL of the server-side assistant proxy that holds the Gemini API key.
# This is a non-secret URL, not a credential.
#   - Same-origin route (recommended):  /api/assistant
#   - Separately deployed Worker:       https://as-assistant-proxy.example.workers.dev
#   - Local proxy dev:                  http://localhost:8787
#
# Leave EMPTY to ship with the live AI assistant disabled. The patient handout
# and guideline-topic answers continue to work; the UI shows "AI assistant
# offline — handout & topics only".
VITE_ASSISTANT_ENDPOINT=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The Gemini API key is NOT configured here. It is set as a server-side secret
# on the proxy only:  cd server && npx wrangler secret put GEMINI_API_KEY
# See server/README.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
